<title>THAILAND: Thai June C/A deficit narrows to 34.0 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai June C/A deficit narrows to 34.0 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's June current account deficit narrowed to an estimated 34.0 billion baht from a revised 35.5 billion baht deficit in May, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   June 96     May 96	   June 95</p>
<p>				 34.0	  35.5		29.9</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
